---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Callout from "@dst/ui/Callout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Food in Azizi Riviera"
  description="Restaurants and groceries in Azizi Riviera — what's on the promenade for daily meals, and where residents go for a wider selection."
>
  <section class="container hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Food</p>
    <h1>Eating in, and eating out</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Between the promenade's casual dining and a supermarket on-site, a
      genuine amount of daily food needs are covered without a car — with a
      clear line for when residents actually drive elsewhere.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>Restaurants</h2>
    <p>
      Casual dining spread across the ground-floor promenade — the kind of
      everyday-meal restaurants that suit a quick dinner rather than a
      destination night out. For a wider or more upscale selection,
      residents typically head to Meydan One or Downtown, both a short
      drive away.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>Groceries and markets</h2>
    <p>
      A supermarket on the promenade covers routine shopping without
      leaving the development. For a wider selection — specialty and
      international groceries in particular — residents typically drive to
      the larger supermarkets in Meydan or Business Bay rather than relying
      on the on-site option for everything.
    </p>
  </section>

  <Callout kind="warn">
    Specific restaurants and the supermarket's own range change as the
    promenade continues to fill in — treat this page as a description of
    categories, not a fixed roster.
  </Callout>
</Layout>

